ldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.16.10 (Kurtz [165])"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"295–296"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"315–316"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in2^\\omega\">\\(G\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>；柱集、测度和有效开集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(G,1)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(G,1)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任一有效闭零类P的补集是测度1的有效开集U。U的枚举串集在每个柱集中有延伸，故稠密；弱1泛型G遇到它，从而G∉P。这里的弱1随机沿用本目录KurtzRandom记号。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.16.10 (Kurtz [165])，印刷页295–296，PDF页315–316。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genericity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-open]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}$ 见 [[43-df-genericity]]，$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]；柱集、测度和有效开集见 [[43-df-cylinder]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}$ 见 [[43-df-genericity]]，$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]；柱集、测度和有效开集见 [[43-df-cylinder]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}$ 见 [[43-df-genericity]]，$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]；柱集、测度和有效开集见 [